        "created_at": "2024-10-01T14:31:56.981Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ramping up the spookiness with Tempest as we prepare for the really spooky month of November.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-295-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-188\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-295-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-188\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-295-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-188\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #295 - Writers' Room: Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #188</a></h3>\n\n  <p>In space, no one can hear you control the weather...  Show Notes: Run Time: 2:00:09 Another two hour episode? Must mean we were recording two episodes in one day again! (That's exactly what happened, in fact!)  Welcome to the first of two spooky...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hYROyjFsdPhVAX10hW3tBL6WS9K\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e065f7d533fe4f6a37f917e68a07e054bb8cda4_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 864 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
