      {
        "id": 261089,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-10-01T18:32:41.815Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Two hours, holy crap. XD</p>\n<p>Wake up, Adam, your friends and family miss you! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>\n<p>Honestly, it’s kind of nice to hear them not know where they’re going with a story for once, the last quite a few have seem fairly well planned.</p>\n<p>Tempest sees dead people!</p>\n<p>Let’s hear it for space cassettes! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>The motifs and everything of this issue are fantastic. I have to wonder if this all fits in one issue of a comic book, even!</p>\n<p>Spiders are the worst!</p>\n<p>Oh boy, it’s the deep sky theorists at it again, eyeroll :V</p>\n<p>Grimm confirmed to exist in the RPG. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\"></p>\n<p>I really like this letter digging into Tempest’s DE design. More of this, please!</p>\n<p>Eww, Orbo fumes. XD</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-10-01T18:32:41.815Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
